<main class="offline" role="main">
  <div class="offline__card">
    <p class="offline__eyebrow">No connection</p>
    <h1 class="offline__title">You are offline</h1>
    <p class="offline__body">
      <%= Rails.application.config.x.product.name %> needs a live internet connection.
      Strategy configuration, bot status, prices, positions and profit/loss are never
      served from a cache, because out-of-date trading information is worse than none.
    </p>
    <p class="offline__body offline__body--muted">
      Your strategy runs on your MT5 Expert Advisor and is unaffected by this device
      losing connectivity. Reconnect to view and manage it again.
    </p>
    <button type="button" class="offline__button" onclick="window.location.reload()">
      Try again
    </button>
  </div>
</main>
